veltos-settings

plasma-desktop
plasma-workspace
udisks2
upower
kdialog
kde-inotify-survey
kwin-x11
libpam-fprintd
webext-plasma-browser-integration
xserver-xorg
sddm
sddm-theme-breeze
plasma-nm
plasma-pa
bluedevil
powerdevil
kscreen
kinfocenter
systemsettings
plasma-systemmonitor
xdg-desktop-portal-kde

veltos-explorer
veltos-taskmanager
veltos-store
konsole
kwrite
ark
gwenview
okular
kde-spectacle
firefox-esr
firefox-esr-l10n-tr

